          <div class="info">
            <h3>LD5ton single girder overhead crane</h3><p>Capacity: 5ton<br>Span length: 16m<br>Lifting height: 9m<br>Work duty: A3<br>Power source: 415V/50Hz/3Ph<br>Indoor Use</p><h3>LD10ton single girder overhead crane</h3><p>Capacity: 10ton<br>Span length: 16m<br>Lifting height: 9m<br>Work Duty: A3<br>Power source: 415V/50Hz/3Ph<br>Indoor Use</p>
            <p>DGCRANE has supplied overhead, gantry and jib cranes to customers in India. For this project, factory and production photographs helped the buyer review the equipment before ordering. The customer approved the proposal, and the enquiry progressed to a signed order in approximately one month.</p>
